flowchart TD
    A([Choose a PDF]) --> B{Password<br/>protected?}
    B -->|Yes| C[Enter password]
    C -->|Wrong| C
    C -->|Right| D[Read-only:<br/>editing off until password removed]
    B -->|No| E[Record in Recents and History]
    D --> E
    E --> F{Read before?}
    F -->|Yes| G[Jump to the last page read]
    F -->|No| H[Start at page 1]
    G --> I[Read: scroll, zoom, search, bookmark]
    H --> I
    I --> J{Scanned or a form?}
    J -->|Scanned| K[Banner: make it searchable with OCR]
    J -->|Form| L[Banner: fill it in]
    J -->|Neither| M([Keep reading])
